      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEAD FOR HOME (2) generally flies the lids but last time was always well back and ran below best, finishing fifth (25.97) in a Grade 5 at Murray Bridge. Fast away and won (25.97) at Murray Bridge the start prior. Hard to go past form here at this journey. Looks the one to beat on his best form. FLYING HUGO (5) is better than last start when fourth (18.00) in a Free For All at this track over 305m. Strike rate this course and distance strong having won five of seven tries. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Should be in this for a long way. GALBA STACEY (8) goes very well here starting six times for three wins and two minors. Hit the frame latest (17.74) when second at this track in a Free For All. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. GUS LIMES (1) is a last-start placegetter at this track and distance - should be thereabouts.",
